      "content": "it works for the vibe but the activist feels a bit too much like a caricature. can u make the dialogue more meaty? like, give the senator some really solid, hard-to-rebut points about national security and the reality of the tech, but keep the activist's side more about the \"feeling\" and the moral outrage rather than specific policy. i want the senator to clearly \"win\" the debate through sheer logic.",
